            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukwí an kudá' Mose nee Aroni taa faár, nee kina alee/iimiís nee geeraharuuseedá' mibaá nee tsár ar xoorór Israeli, umuú geeraharusmoowo ina sihhiít as daanduú tlahhaywós. ",
